@startuml
title CQRS + Event Sourcing - Data flow (advanced)
actor Client
rectangle "Write side" {
  node "Command API" as Cmd
  node "Aggregate\n(validate business rules)" as Agg
  database "Event store\n(append-only, per-stream version)" as ES
}
queue "Kafka: domain events" as K
rectangle "Read side" {
  node "Projector: order summary" as P1
  node "Projector: search index" as P2
  node "Projector: analytics" as P3
  database "Read DB (Postgres)\norder_summary view" as R1
  database "Elasticsearch" as R2
  database "ClickHouse" as R3
  node "Query API" as Q
}
Client --> Cmd : 1. PlaceOrder command
Cmd --> Agg : 2. load events -> rebuild state
Agg --> ES : 3. append OrderPlaced\n(optimistic lock on version)
ES --> K : 4. outbox / CDC publish
K --> P1 : 5. consume (idempotent)
K --> P2
K --> P3
P1 --> R1 : 6. upsert view
P2 --> R2
P3 --> R3
Client --> Q : A. GET /orders/123
Q --> R1 : B. read (eventually consistent)
Q --> R2 : search
@enduml
